          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ɛŋa mi pɛl mi dee nɛmɛ wä lɔcdɛ? Ɛŋa ci Kuoth Nhial ruac kɛ jɛ mɔ, min dee jɛ ben lat? Ɛŋu mi däk wec a cɛ te ni baaŋ ce̱tnikɛ därdɔaar a thilɛ ram mi dee rët kɛ jɛ? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Kuoth Nhial wee i̱, “Ɛ ɣöö ca ŋuɔ̱tkä ba̱ny piny kɛn tëë cä ka̱m kɛ, kä /ka̱n ruacdä luɔ̱th, kä /ka̱n la̱t ni luëëkä, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "cu kɛ la̱t ni cär lɔacdiɛn, kä cukɛ guɔ̱ɔ̱r ni kuth Baal ce̱tnikɛ mëë ca nyuɔ̱thkɛ ɛ gua̱ni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kui̱ ɛmɔ cu Kuoth Nhial in la Ruey Ɣɔaa min la Kuoth I-thɛ-rɛl ruac, ɛn ɣöö nɛnɛ, ɣän bä kɛn nɛy ti̱ti̱ mi̱eeth kɛ kɔ̱a̱m kä bä kɛ ka̱m pi̱w lueŋä ti ba math. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä bä kɛ riaw rɛy dööri ti kui̱c kɛn kɛ kä kui̱c gua̱ni kɛ, kä bä rɛm jäk kä kɔɔriɛn amäni mi cä kɛ thuk.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.9.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Thiec ji̱ Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm kɛ luääk",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 9:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.9.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 9:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Kuoth Nhial wee i̱, “Ɛ ram mi pɛl pɛl /ci rɔ liak kɛ pɛlɛ, kä ɛ ram mi bum /ci rɔ liak kɛ buɔ̱mdɛ, kä ɛ ram mi riäŋ riäŋ /ci rɔ liak kɛ ria̱ŋdɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.9.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 9:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ram mi liak rɔ, a rɔ liakɛ kɛ nɛmɛ, ɛ rɔ liakɛ kɛ ɣöö cɛ ɣä ŋa̱c, ɛn ɣöö ɛ jɛn ɣän Kuoth Nhial min tekɛ nhök mi thil pek, kɛ thuɔ̱k kɛnɛ cuŋ wi̱i̱ muɔ̱ɔ̱n. Kɛ ɣöö kɛn ti̱ti̱ nhɔakä kɛ, ruac ni ɣän Kuoth Nhial.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.9.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 9:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.9.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 9:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Kuoth Nhial wee i̱, “Ci ni̱n tin bä nɛy diaal tin rɔamkɛ ni ŋuɔ̱t, kä /ca mat ruacdä tit duäc thi̱n. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.9.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 9:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ji̱ I-jëp, kɛ ji̱ Juda kɛ ji̱ Ɛ-pa-rim kɛ ji̱ Am-on kɛnɛ ji̱ Mo-ab, kɛ nɛy diaal tin cieŋ däär dɔaar kɛnɛ gua̱th tin na̱n, kɛ ɣöö kɛn döör ti̱ti̱ diaal /ca mat ruacdä tit, amäni ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl diaal /ca lät ni ɣä ikä.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.9.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
